  "idea": "Automated employee equipment ordering and home office stipend flow",
  "text": "This automated procurement flow handles international hardware shipping, customs clearance, and laptop returns effortlessly. Expanding abroad usually forces operations managers to juggle fragmented local vendors and expensive import tariffs. Spreadsheets fail the moment an overseas contractor departs and their company laptop gets stranded abroad. Instead, platform solutions like Firstbase manage device lifecycles, deploy Jamf profiles, and automate courier retrievals. You protect company assets while slashing logistics time.",
